!! Multifrontal direct solver with BLR compression (METHOD=DIRECTmf, option line BLR=1,
!! tile size 12 and no distance skip so the compression engages on this small model):
!! checks that the option lines are read, the compressed factorization plus iterative
!! refinement reproduces the reference computed by DIRECT, and the log check asserts
!! that tiles were actually compressed.
!BOUNDARY
  FIX, 1, 3,   0.0
!CLOAD
  CL1,    3,  -1.0
!!
!! SOLVER CONTROL
!!
!SOLVER,METHOD=DIRECTmf,ITERLOG=YES,TIMELOG=YES,LOGLEVEL=1
 10000, 1
 1.0e-8, 1.0, 0.0
 0, 0, 1, 0, 12, 0, -1
!WRITE,RESULT
!END
